{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group_dynamic","type":"group","x":-1400,"y":400,"width":3600,"height":2600,"label":"动态区：完整执行流程"},
		{"id":"group_static","type":"group","x":-1400,"y":-400,"width":3600,"height":700,"label":"静态区：核心模块定义"},
		{"id":"module_fetcher","type":"text","text":"**Arxiv 获取器\n(ArxivFetcher)**\n\n- 连接 arXiv 数据库\n- 根据关键词抓取论文元数据\n- 解析 XML 响应流\n- 防止过快请求 (delay 2s)","file":"get_arxiv_papers","x":-600,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"#2196f3"},
		{"id":"module_prompt","type":"text","text":"**Prompt 构建器\n(Prompt Builder)**\n\n- 使用 ARXIV_PROMPT_TEMPLATE\n- 填充 {title} 和 {summary}\n- 强制 JSON 输出格式\n- 设置 temperature=0.3","x":-250,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"#00bcd4"},
		{"id":"module_ai","type":"text","text":"**AI 分析器\n(DeepSeek V3)**\n\n- 接收 structured prompt\n- 扮演专家角色\n- 提取创新点、商业价值\n- 输出机器可读 JSON","x":100,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"#e91e63"},
		{"id":"module_parser","type":"text","text":"**响应解析器\n(Response Parser)**\n\n- json.loads() 解析 AI 返回\n- 提取: summary, category,\n  innovation, commercial_score\n- 数据类型转换","x":450,"y":-200,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"#4caf50"},
		{"id":"module_auth","type":"text","text":"**飞书鉴权器\n(Feishu Auth)**\n\n- 使用 APP_ID + APP_SECRET\n- 向 open.feishu.cn 发起 POST\n- 获取 tenant_access_token\n- 有效期 2 小时","file":"get_tenant_token","x":-950,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"#9c27b0"},
		{"id":"module_mapper","type":"text","text":"**字段映射器\n(Field Mapper)**\n\n- 代码字段 → 飞书列名对齐\n- 日期转毫秒时间戳\n- URL 转超链接 Object\n- 构建 fields 字典","x":770,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"#ffeb3b"},
		{"id":"flow_title","type":"text","text":"**完整流程：ETL 自动化工作流**\n(Extract → Transform → Load)","x":-1300,"y":480,"width":500,"height":50},
		{"id":"module_config","type":"text","text":"**环境配置器\n(Config Loader)**\n\n- 读取 .env 文件\n- 加载 API Keys (DeepSeek, 飞书)\n- 初始化环境变量\n- 安全管理敏感信息","x":-1300,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"#ff9800"},
		{"id":"step0_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 0: 环境初始化**","x":-1300,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"step1_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 1: 飞书身份验证**","x":-950,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"step2_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 2: 获取 arXiv 论文**","x":-600,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"step3_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 3: 构建分析 Prompt**","x":-250,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"step4_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 4: AI 深度分析**","x":100,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"step5_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 5: 解析 AI 响应**","x":450,"y":600,"width":300,"height":40},
		{"id":"step6_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 6: 字段映射**","x":770,"y":600,"width":320,"height":40},
		{"id":"module_writer","type":"text","text":"**飞书写入器\n(Feishu Writer)**\n\n- 调用 bitable/v1/records API\n- 携带 tenant_access_token\n- 写入多维表格\n- 返回 code: 0 (成功)","file":"analyze_and_write","x":1110,"y":-200,"width":340,"height":220,"color":"#795548"},
		{"id":"step7_title","type":"text","text":"**Step 7: 写入飞书表格**","x":1110,"y":600,"width":340,"height":40},
		{"id":"step0_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\n.env 文件路径","x":-1300,"y":660,"width":320,"height":60,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step1_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nFEISHU_APP_ID\nFEISHU_APP_SECRET","x":-950,"y":660,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step2_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nARXIV_LIMIT=10\ncategories=['cs.CL','cs.AI']","x":-600,"y":660,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step3_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\npaper['title']\npaper['summary']\nARXIV_PROMPT_TEMPLATE","x":-250,"y":660,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step4_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nstructured_prompt\nmodel: deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3\ntemperature: 0.3","x":100,"y":660,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step5_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nAI JSON 响应字符串","x":450,"y":660,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step6_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nAI 分析 Dict\n论文原始数据 (URL, Title)\ntenant_token (Step 1)","x":770,"y":660,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step7_input","type":"text","text":"输入:\nfields Dict\nTABLE_ID\ntenant_token","x":1110,"y":660,"width":340,"height":80,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step0_config","type":"text","text":"环境配置器\n(load_dotenv)","x":-1300,"y":740,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#ff9800"},
		{"id":"step5_parser","type":"text","text":"响应解析器\n(json.loads + 提取字段)","x":450,"y":740,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"#4caf50"},
		{"id":"step1_auth","type":"text","text":"飞书鉴权器\n(POST open.feishu.cn)","x":-950,"y":760,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9c27b0"},
		{"id":"step6_mapper","type":"text","text":"字段映射器\n(对齐飞书列名 + 类型转换)","x":770,"y":780,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#ffeb3b"},
		{"id":"step7_writer","type":"text","text":"飞书写入器\n(POST bitable API)","x":1110,"y":760,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"#795548"},
		{"id":"step0_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\n环境变量已加载\n(API Keys 可用)","x":-1300,"y":860,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step5_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\nPython Dict:\n(summary, category,\n innovation, score)","x":450,"y":860,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step1_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\ntenant_access_token\n(有效期 2h)","x":-950,"y":880,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step7_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\ncode: 0 (成功)\n控制台: ✅ 写入成功\n飞书: 新增一行记录","x":1110,"y":880,"width":390,"height":140,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step6_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\nfields Dict:\n{论文标题, 商业潜力,\n 推荐指数, 链接, 时间}","x":770,"y":900,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"loop_note","type":"text","text":"**循环执行**\n\nStep 3-7 会为每篇论文\n执行一次循环\n\n典型配置:\nARXIV_LIMIT=10\n→ 循环 10 次\n\n防抖措施:\n- delay_seconds=2\n- 避免被 arXiv 封 IP","x":-1300,"y":1100,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"#ff5722"},
		{"id":"etl_note","type":"text","text":"**ETL 架构总结**\n\n1. **Extract (抽取)**\n   - 从 arXiv 抽取原始数据\n   - 元数据: title, summary, authors\n\n2. **Transform (转换)**\n   - LLM 将非结构化文本\n     转为结构化洞察\n   - 评分、分类、中文总结\n\n3. **Load (加载)**\n   - 写入飞书多维表格\n   - 可视化数据库供消费","x":-850,"y":1100,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"#3f51b5"},
		{"id":"data_flow_note","type":"text","text":"**数据流特点**\n\n1. **原始数据源**\n   - arXiv API (XML)\n   - 非结构化文本\n\n2. **AI 增值**\n   - DeepSeek V3 理解\n   - 输出结构化 JSON\n   - 包含: 总结/分类/评分\n\n3. **类型转换**\n   - String → Dict (JSON)\n   - Score → Number\n   - URL → Link Object\n   - Date → Timestamp\n\n4. **持久化**\n   - 飞书多维表格\n   - 支持查询/筛选/排序","x":-400,"y":1100,"width":400,"height":360,"color":"#009688"},
		{"id":"key_features_note","type":"text","text":"**核心特性**\n\n1. **自动化**\n   - 无需人工干预\n   - 定时抓取 + 分析\n\n2. **AI 增值**\n   - 原始摘要 → 专家解读\n   - 商业潜力评分\n   - 中文总结\n\n3. **结构化输出**\n   - 强制 JSON 格式\n   - 机器可读\n   - 易于存储/检索\n\n4. **可扩展性**\n   - 支持多数据源\n   - 可换其他 LLM\n   - 可自定义 Prompt","x":450,"y":1100,"width":380,"height":540,"color":"#673ab7"},
		{"id":"tech_stack_note","type":"text","text":"**技术栈**\n\n- **语言**: Python 3.x\n- **HTTP**: requests\n- **配置**: python-dotenv\n- **AI**: DeepSeek V3 (SiliconFlow)\n- **存储**: 飞书多维表格 API\n- **数据源**: arXiv API\n\n**关键依赖**:\n- ArxivFetcher (自定义模块)\n- 飞书开放平台 API\n- SiliconFlow 代理","x":870,"y":1100,"width":400,"height":420,"color":"#607d8b"},
		{"id":"workflow_note","type":"text","text":"**工作流特点**\n\n1. **流水线架构**\n   - 每个步骤职责单一\n   - 易于调试/维护\n\n2. **状态管理**\n   - Token 缓存 (2h 有效期)\n   - 顺序执行\n\n3. **批处理**\n   - 一次处理 N 篇论文\n   - 减少 API 调用开销\n\n4. **可观测性**\n   - 打印关键步骤日志\n   - 成功/失败清晰可见","x":1310,"y":1100,"width":380,"height":460,"color":"#00bcd4"},
		{"id":"step2_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\nList[Dict]\n{title, summary, authors,\n id, source:'arxiv'}","x":-600,"y":920,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step2_fetcher","type":"text","text":"Arxiv 获取器\n(查询 + 解析 XML)","x":-600,"y":780,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#2196f3"},
		{"id":"step3_prompt","type":"text","text":"Prompt 构建器\n(填充模板 + 强制 JSON)","x":-250,"y":840,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#00bcd4"},
		{"id":"step3_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\nstructured_prompt\n(含 JSON format 约束)","x":-280,"y":960,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step4_output","type":"text","text":"输出:\nAI JSON 响应:\n{summary, category,\n innovation,\n commercial_score,\n recommendation}","x":100,"y":920,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"#9e9e9e"},
		{"id":"step4_ai","type":"text","text":"AI 分析器\n(专家评估 + 打分)","x":90,"y":800,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"#e91e63"},
		{"id":"error_handling_note","type":"text","text":"**错误处理机制**\n\n1. **API 调用失败**\n   - 飞书鉴权: 打印错误日志\n   - DeepSeek: 异常捕获\n\n2. **数据格式错误**\n   - JSON 解析失败\n   - 字段缺失处理\n\n3. **网络限流**\n   - arXiv delay 2s\n   - 防止 IP 被封\n\n4. **写入验证**\n   - 检查 code == 0\n   - 打印成功/失败状态","x":40,"y":1120,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"#f44336"}
	],
	"edges":[
